  p_Description_592dda735e54 := 'Cohere Rerank 4 Fast - Distilled, cost-efficient reranking model released December 16, 2025. 32K tokens per document, 100+ language support. Optimized for lower latency and higher throughput RAG pipelines where Rerank 4 Pro quality is not required. Cohere standard pricing applies: $1.50 per 1,000 search units (not modeled here because rerank pricing does not map cleanly to Per-1M-Tokens unit types). API id corrected 2026-10-05: the callable id is `rerank-v4.0-fast`, not `rerank-v4-fast` - Cohere spells it with the ".0" in its own docs source (fern/pages/models/rerank-2.mdx, models.mdx and the 2025-12-11 rerank-v4 changelog). The record Name stays `rerank-v4-fast` because metadata/prompts/.default-rerank-prompt.json resolves it by name. Source: https://github.com/cohere-ai/cohere-developer-experience/blob/main/fern/pages/models/rerank-2.mdx';
