  p_CostRank_d6279f907ebd := 0;
  p_ModelSelectionInsights_d6279f907ebd := 'Best for: multilingual content and longer documents. MJ truncates inputs at 2,048 tokens: the model accepts 8,192, but one 8,192-token text needs about 8.4 GB of memory. In MJ''s retrieval benchmark it roughly tied all-mpnet-base-v2 on English queries and clearly beat every other local model on Spanish, German and French queries. Costs: about 0.9 GB of memory after loading (q8), up to about 4 GB while embedding a full batch, and roughly 30-110 ms per short text on CPU, so saves that embed (agent notes, tags, queries) get slower. PowerRank sits below all-mpnet-base-v2, so it is not the default while that model is active: opt in by setting the MJ_DEFAULT_LOCAL_EMBEDDING_MODEL environment variable to ''EmbeddingGemma 2 (Local)'' for every MJ process, then run the Re-embed Local Vectors action.';
